Derived file: src/x86_ref_mcp/data/xed-insns.json.gz
  Source: XED datafiles at commit 0bcb6237345c5066726dcc08b3d87928df3b5b26,
  merged by XED's own generator (mfile.py just-prep, mbuild commit
  1b437e409221a2b5703b4d8896baa20d43e4ba1a) and parsed by XED's
  pysrc/read_xed_db.py.
  Changes: a subset of each instruction record (iclass, iform, operands,
  ISA set, extension, category, CPL, attributes, flags, exception class,
  CPUID requirements, mode restriction, disassembly names) was extracted
  and re-serialised as JSON by tools/build_data.py. No XED source code is
  included.

The register, MSR and exception-vector tables (src/x86_ref_mcp/arch.py)
and the curated notes (src/x86_ref_mcp/exceptions.py) were written for
this project and are MIT-licensed. No text from the Intel(R) 64 and IA-32
Architectures Software Developer's Manual is included.
